# PR template (mandatory for agents) — App Updater

Use **`.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md`** — compact checklist for on-device updater work, not the full Hemopro Engineering Notebook.

## Focus

- Download / install / verify flows on edge devices
- **Client impact** and failure modes (network, disk, retry)
- Manual/device test evidence when behavior changes

## Do not

- Copy Hemopro patient/dialysis/Jira Feature Risk boilerplate unless this PR also tracks a HEM card
- Open PR with empty body or commit-list-only summary
